g class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/745950/extras/89f7bde1c66fa5df7ed389dfb11565f3.avif?t=1728311631\" /></div><br>Use your camera and audio recorder to prove the existence of the supernatural. <br>You can speak with ghosts using the Spirit Board, a well-known spiritual communication device. <br>But beware! Choose your questions wisely, discouraging or angering those you summon could be disastrous...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/745950/extras/24e4b48cb7725c7a077eb247d1833594.poster.avif?t=1728311631\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/745950/extras/24e4b48cb7725c7a077eb247d1833594.webm?t=1728311631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/745950/extras/24e4b48cb7725c7a077eb247d1833594.mp4?t=1728311631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/745950/extras/391e1fa8048785bceee89fba8d623fff.avif?t=1728311631\" /></div><br>The more traces of ghosts you record, the more gear customization options are made available. <br>Use your tools wisely and try to stay alive \u2013 supernatural beings don\u2019t like to be recorded! <br>Hide from all the dangerous creatures to keep your progress and explore deeper into the forest.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/745950/extras/8aed2f1a42813e02f722e7d07bf563c6.poster.avif?t=1728311631\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/745950/extras/8aed2f1a42813e02f722e7d07bf563c6.webm?t=1728311631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source